1. Criar `src/Ciclo.Core/Entities/AcademicYear.cs`, `src/Ciclo.Core/Entities/SchoolClass.cs`, `src/Ciclo.Core/Entities/CurriculumComponent.cs`, `src/Ciclo.Core/Entities/Assessment.cs` e `src/Ciclo.Core/Entities/Grade.cs` com exatamente as propriedades declaradas nos Componentes correspondentes de `design.md`; todas implementam `ITenantScoped` seguindo o padrão de `src/Ciclo.Core/Entities/Student.cs`.
